# Radio page tour A: the cold start. The product starts the opening by itself 2 s after launch (Station.start, in demo and not), so the cold
# start (greeting, one Play) exists only before that: the first shot is taken at once, with no wait. If it already plays, run again. Install runsheet-cold.json as <app container>/Library/Application Support/Autoradio/runsheet.json
# (delete open-pages.json too) before the launch. Demo mode on. @S@ is the shots directory.
clock data
tree
screenshot @S@/A01-cold-start.png window
tap radio-play
clock +3500 real
clock data
tree
screenshot @S@/A02-on-air-opening.png window
clock +4000 real
clock data
tree
screenshot @S@/A03-on-air-later.png window
tap radio-play
clock +900 real
clock data
tree
screenshot @S@/A04-paused.png window
